GIVETH A LIST OF CrossReference
`the cross-reference rows` MEANS
    LIST `row X001`,
         `row X002`,
         `row X003`,
         `row X004`,
         `row X005`,
         `row X006`,
         `row X007`,
         `row X008`,
         `row X009`,
         `row X010`,
         `row X011`,
         `row X012`,
         `row X013`,
         `row X014`,
         `row X015`,
         `row X016`,
         `row X017`,
         `row X018`,
         `row X019`,
         `row X020`,
         `row X021`,
         `row X022`,
         `row X023`,
         `row X024`,
         `row X025`,
         `row X026`,
         `row X027`,
         `row X028`,
         `row X029`,
         `row X030`,
         `row X031`,
         `row X032`,
         `row X033`,
         `row X034`,
         `row X035`,
         `row X036`,
         `row X037`,
         `row X038`,
         `row X039`,
         `row X040`,
         `row X041`,
         `row X042`,
         `row X043`

GIVEN `the rows left to count` IS A LIST OF CrossReference
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the number of rows in` IS
    CONSIDER `the rows left to count`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN 0
    WHEN x FOLLOWED BY rest THEN 1 PLUS `the number of rows in` rest

GIVEN `the row` IS A CrossReference
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the section cited is in the index` IF
    CONSIDER `the provision with the identifier` (`the row`'s `section cited`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST p THEN TRUE

GIVEN `the row` IS A CrossReference
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the subsection cited is printed in the section` IF
    (`the row`'s `subsection cited` EQUALS "") OR (`the provision prints the subsection` (`the row`'s `section cited`) (`the row`'s `subsection cited`))

GIVEN `the row` IS A CrossReference
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the heading of the row is the index heading` IF
    `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` (`the row`'s `section cited`) EQUALS JUST (`the row`'s `heading of the cited section as printed`)
